
### STEP 11 — Post-Game Recalibration (after results)
- Update ELO for both teams using MOV-adjusted formula
- Adjust FPI ±0.5 based on performance vs. expectation
- Recalculate SHAP feature importance; up-weight best features (+5%), down-weight worst (-10%)
- Re-optimize ensemble weights via MSE minimization
- Apply Platt scaling if calibration curve deviates >5%
- Track Brier Score (target <0.22 NFL); update running CLV average
- Weekly (Mondays): full model retraining, walk-forward cross-validation, hyperparameter grid search

